    "bodyText": "/\nRevenue Metric Card\nExport\nShare\nPreview\nScreens\nCode\n/index\nWelcome to Magic Patterns\n\nThe AI design tool for product teams.\n\nContinue\n\nCreate a clean SaaS analytics metric card with revenue chart and trend badge\n\n1 tool used\n\nBuilding a single revenue card: a large headline figure, a trend badge comparing to the previous period, a range switcher, and an area chart with hover tooltips. I've assumed a light, neutral look with one indigo accent.\n\nMaking 2 edits\nReplacedpackage.json\n+16\nReplacingindex.css\n\n\n\n\nAuto\nStop\nShare"
